[
{
"start": 0.0,
"end": 2.352,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Welcome back to Trail Sessions.",
"char_start": 17,
"char_end": 48,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s01"
},
{
"start": 2.352,
"end": 10.772,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Today, we're talking about drivetrain mechanics, and I'm joined by Tiago Moreira, a mechanic at Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 49,
"char_end": 160,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s02"
},
{
"start": 10.772,
"end": 13.806,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tiago Moreira, thank you for being here.",
"char_start": 161,
"char_end": 201,
"unit_id": "t0000.u01",
"sent_id": "t0000.s03"
},
{
"start": 13.806,
"end": 16.051,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
"char_start": 217,
"char_end": 236,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s01"
},
{
"start": 16.051,
"end": 17.941,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Glad to be back.",
"char_start": 237,
"char_end": 253,
"unit_id": "t0001.u01",
"sent_id": "t0001.s02"
},
{
"start": 17.941,
"end": 21.524,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Today's episode is sponsored by Notion.",
"char_start": 271,
"char_end": 310,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s01"
},
{
"start": 21.524,
"end": 26.762,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team uses every day.",
"char_start": 311,
"char_end": 368,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 26.762,
"end": 28.691,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 369,
"char_end": 390,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 28.691,
"end": 39.811,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we get into the topic, Inês Carvalho was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension adjustments.",
"char_start": 391,
"char_end": 537,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 39.811,
"end": 40.639,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 553,
"char_end": 566,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 40.639,
"end": 44.014,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to discuss today.",
"char_start": 567,
"char_end": 620,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 44.014,
"end": 51.317,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point something out – Inês Carvalho mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 638,
"char_end": 731,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.317,
"end": 59.008,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to point something out – Rafael Vasconcelos mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 732,
"char_end": 830,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 59.008,
"end": 61.015,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 831,
"char_end": 864,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 61.015,
"end": 64.602,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and have you revisited it?",
"char_start": 865,
"char_end": 924,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 64.602,
"end": 73.475,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "In short, most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 940,
"char_end": 1077,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 73.475,
"end": 77.231,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1078,
"char_end": 1136,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 77.231,
"end": 81.894,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1137,
"char_end": 1209,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 81.894,
"end": 83.661,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "It's a useful framework.",
"char_start": 1227,
"char_end": 1251,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 83.661,
"end": 87.932,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1252,
"char_end": 1310,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 87.932,
"end": 89.26,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1326,
"char_end": 1346,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 89.26,
"end": 95.831,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1347,
"char_end": 1446,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 95.831,
"end": 100.345,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1447,
"char_end": 1515,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 100.345,
"end": 102.465,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1533,
"char_end": 1566,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 102.465,
"end": 107.025,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1567,
"char_end": 1638,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 107.025,
"end": 107.66,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1654,
"char_end": 1664,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 107.66,
"end": 114.329,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you will need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1665,
"char_end": 1770,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 114.329,
"end": 117.441,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1771,
"char_end": 1820,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 117.441,
"end": 122.078,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The context matters because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1821,
"char_end": 1894,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 122.078,
"end": 123.792,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tell me more about it.",
"char_start": 1912,
"char_end": 1934,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 123.792,
"end": 128.179,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1950,
"char_end": 2019,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 128.179,
"end": 132.375,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2020,
"char_end": 2086,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 132.375,
"end": 134.486,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tell me how you made the decision.",
"char_start": 2104,
"char_end": 2138,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 134.486,
"end": 138.211,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "How does the RockShox suspension system fit into this frame?",
"char_start": 2139,
"char_end": 2199,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 138.211,
"end": 138.855,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 2215,
"char_end": 2225,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 138.855,
"end": 143.75,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 2226,
"char_end": 2302,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 143.75,
"end": 149.482,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "If you ignore this, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2303,
"char_end": 2392,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 149.482,
"end": 151.045,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "You know what else?",
"char_start": 2410,
"char_end": 2429,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 151.045,
"end": 156.638,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "I'll say it plainly: Linear manages my entire engineering operation.",
"char_start": 2430,
"char_end": 2498,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 156.638,
"end": 162.724,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is a task manager designed for speed – it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2499,
"char_end": 2573,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 162.724,
"end": 165.521,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2574,
"char_end": 2608,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
"start": 165.521,
"end": 169.671,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "We'll be right back, after a short commercial break.",
"char_start": 2609,
"char_end": 2661,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s05"
},
