"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 196.771,
"end": 197.945,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 2998,
"char_end": 3018,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 197.945,
"end": 205.281,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 3019,
"char_end": 3144,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 205.281,
"end": 208.92,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this happen with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3145,
"char_end": 3207,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 208.92,
"end": 212.97,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3208,
"char_end": 3277,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 212.97,
"end": 214.412,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 3295,
"char_end": 3322,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 214.412,
"end": 218.739,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and have you since changed your mind?",
"char_start": 3323,
"char_end": 3404,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 218.739,
"end": 227.057,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Yes, so – a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 3420,
"char_end": 3529,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 227.057,
"end": 232.17,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3530,
"char_end": 3597,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 232.17,
"end": 233.289,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3615,
"char_end": 3637,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 233.289,
"end": 237.408,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What did you believe about this, and what have you since learned or reconsidered?",
"char_start": 3638,
"char_end": 3719,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 237.408,
"end": 238.798,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3735,
"char_end": 3755,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 238.798,
"end": 245.333,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3756,
"char_end": 3850,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 245.333,
"end": 249.156,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3851,
"char_end": 3906,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 249.156,
"end": 253.744,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3907,
"char_end": 3973,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 253.744,
"end": 254.916,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That makes sense.",
"char_start": 3991,
"char_end": 4008,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 254.916,
"end": 266.171,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within that workflow, the commitment becomes evident. If you ignore that, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 4024,
"char_end": 4200,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 266.171,
"end": 267.405,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 4218,
"char_end": 4236,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 267.405,
"end": 272.686,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4237,
"char_end": 4314,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 272.686,
"end": 273.983,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 4330,
"char_end": 4350,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 273.983,
"end": 278.911,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 4351,
"char_end": 4427,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 278.911,
"end": 283.19,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4428,
"char_end": 4494,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 283.19,
