},
{
"start": 320.533,
"end": 325.481,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the opposing viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 5202,
"char_end": 5274,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 325.481,
"end": 332.283,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "In essence, a bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your focus remains on the trail.",
"char_start": 5290,
"char_end": 5386,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 332.283,
"end": 337.88,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what kind of performance you can expect.",
"char_start": 5387,
"char_end": 5466,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 337.88,
"end": 339.577,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the failure mode?",
"char_start": 5484,
"char_end": 5509,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 339.577,
"end": 343.988,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5510,
"char_end": 5575,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 343.988,
"end": 350.798,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Honestly, the wear on the chain is the best early indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 5591,
"char_end": 5695,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s01"
},
{
"start": 350.798,
"end": 354.268,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 5696,
"char_end": 5749,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s02"
},
{
"start": 354.268,
"end": 358.786,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5750,
"char_end": 5819,
"unit_id": "t0033.u01",
"sent_id": "t0033.s03"
},
{
"start": 358.786,
"end": 361.165,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where does it stop working?",
"char_start": 5837,
"char_end": 5864,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 361.165,
"end": 370.902,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And when teams embrace Shimano in that way, the commitment becomes evident – I saw this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5880,
"char_end": 6015,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 370.902,
"end": 373.704,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "What heuristic do you always go back to?",
"char_start": 6033,
"char_end": 6073,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 373.704,
"end": 377.767,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 6074,
"char_end": 6132,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 377.767,
"end": 384.113,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 6148,
"char_end": 6234,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 384.113,
"end": 389.13,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 6235,
"char_end": 6303,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 389.13,
"end": 395.422,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we finish, what's one thing listeners can try out this week?",
"char_start": 6321,
"char_end": 6388,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 395.422,
"end": 399.64,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and apply it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6404,
"char_end": 6468,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 399.64,
"end": 401.552,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Everything else is iteration.",
"char_start": 6469,
"char_end": 6498,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 401.552,
"end": 406.149,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Before we close, thank you again to our friends at Linear.",
"char_start": 6516,
"char_end": 6574,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s01"
},
{
"start": 406.149,
"end": 412.966,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Linear is a task management tool designed for speed – it's optimized for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 6575,
"char_end": 6661,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s02"
},
{
"start": 412.966,
"end": 415.937,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "Tiago Moreira, thank you for the conversation.",
"char_start": 6662,
"char_end": 6708,
"unit_id": "t0040.u01",
"sent_id": "t0040.s03"
},
{
"start": 415.937,
"end": 418.179,
"speaker_label": "Tiago Moreira",
"text": "Thank you, Beatriz.",
"char_start": 6724,
"char_end": 6743,
"unit_id": "t0041.u01",
"sent_id": "t0041.s01"
},
{
"start": 418.179,
"end": 420.827,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "That's all for today's Trail Sessions.",
"char_start": 6761,
"char_end": 6799,
"unit_id": "t0042.u01",
"sent_id": "t0042.s01"
},
{
"start": 420.827,
"end": 422.081,
"speaker_label": "Beatriz Antunes",
"text": "See you next time.",
"char_start": 6800,
"char_end": 6818,
